WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.416
<b>In the last two verses, Lord Krishna stated</b>

2
00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:36.750
<b>that this spiritual knowledge is so pure</b>

3
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:43.208
<b>that by obtaining it, even the greatest sinner </b>
<b>can cross this world of material miseries,</b>

4
00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:47.541
<b>and just as fire burns wood to ashes,</b>

5
00:00:47.541 --> 00:00:53.416
<b>this knowledge burns all the </b>
<b>fruits of actions to ashes.</b>

6
00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:57.583
<b>So now, restlessness may certainly </b>
<b>arise in someone's mind:</b>

7
00:00:57.583 --> 00:01:01.833
<b>how long can it take to obtain such </b>
<b>invaluable knowledge?</b>

8
00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:04.916
<b>Can it not be obtained quickly?</b>

9
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:07.291
<b>The answer to this is in this verse.</b>

10
00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:14.625
<b>In this verse, Lord Krishna says</b>

11
00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:19.833
<b>that in this world, nothing is as pure and </b>
<b>divine as this spiritual knowledge.</b>

12
00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:26.000
<b>And the person who attains the perfect state </b>
<b>of yoga - especially Nishkam Karma Yoga – </b>

13
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.041
<b>sees this knowledge spontaneously </b>
<b>awakening within themselves over time</b>

14
00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:34.958
<b>and then enjoys it.</b>

15
00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:39.875
<b>It is extremely important to understand </b>
<b>these four points in this verse.</b>

16
00:01:39.875 --> 00:01:41.083
<b>Firstly -</b>

17
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:42.791
<b>the purity of this knowledge:</b>

18
00:01:42.791 --> 00:01:48.041
<b>There are many purifications, physical</b>
<b>purification, mental purification,</b>

19
00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:50.541
<b>freedom from any addiction, etc.,</b>

20
00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:56.000
<b>but the most sacred is the purification </b>
<b>obtained from spiritual knowledge.</b>

21
00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:59.375
<b>This knowledge removes the </b>
<b>darkness of ignorance from life</b>

22
00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:05.416
<b>and consequently frees us from the </b>
<b>bonds of this material world.</b>

23
00:02:05.416 --> 00:02:07.791
<b>The second important point is –</b>

24
00:02:07.791 --> 00:02:10.583
<b>the path to attain this knowledge:</b>

25
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:13.375
<b>To attain such rare knowledge,</b>

26
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:17.291
<b>one will have to continuously </b>
<b>practice Nishkam Karma Yoga.</b>

27
00:02:17.291 --> 00:02:22.666
<b>That is, one will have to fulfill duties, </b>
<b>perform all actions,</b>

28
00:02:22.666 --> 00:02:26.625
<b>but without any attachment.</b>

29
00:02:26.625 --> 00:02:30.333
<b>The third important point is - </b>
<b>the nature of this knowledge:</b>

30
00:02:30.333 --> 00:02:34.541
<b>The true nature of this knowledge </b>
<b>is not words written in a book,</b>

31
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:39.666
<b>nor can it be obtained by any external vow or fast.</b>

32
00:02:39.666 --> 00:02:42.833
<b>The true nature of this knowledge is internal.</b>

33
00:02:42.833 --> 00:02:47.250
<b>As a person becomes purified</b>
<b>through Nishkam Karma Yoga,</b>

34
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.958
<b>this knowledge begins to illuminate from within.</b>

35
00:02:50.958 --> 00:02:54.541
<b>External activities can certainly help,</b>

36
00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:58.916
<b>but the real nature of this knowledge is internal.</b>

37
00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:01.250
<b>And the fourth important point is -</b>

38
00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.666
<b>the right time:</b>

39
00:03:03.666 --> 00:03:08.750
<b>In this verse, the word 'kālam' means</b>
<b>at the appropriate time.</b>

40
00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:13.458
<b>This shows the importance of patience </b>
<b>in this spiritual journey.</b>

41
00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:21.041
<b>Lord Krishna is warning that this knowledge </b>
<b>can never be obtained in haste or hurry.</b>

42
00:03:21.041 --> 00:03:23.833
<b>Because if you are being impatient,</b>

43
00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:28.666
<b>it simply means that you have developed</b>
<b>a craving for this knowledge,</b>

44
00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:32.333
<b>and this is contrary to Nishkam Yoga.</b>

45
00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:34.083
<b>One will have to be patient,</b>

46
00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:37.375
<b>perform actions without attachment,</b>

47
00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:41.916
<b>and at the right time, this knowledge </b>
<b>will automatically be revealed.</b>

48
00:03:41.916 --> 00:03:43.833
<b>The essence of this verse is</b>

49
00:03:43.833 --> 00:03:46.208
<b>that this divine spiritual knowledge</b>

50
00:03:46.208 --> 00:03:51.791
<b>is the ultimate goal of all spiritual </b>
<b>endeavors, sacrifices, and practices.</b>

51
00:03:51.791 --> 00:03:57.375
<b>So being impatient to obtain such rare </b>
<b>knowledge would be the biggest mistake.</b>

52
00:03:57.375 --> 00:04:03.791
<b>Let it not be that the intense craving to obtain </b>
<b>this knowledge itself takes it away from you.</b>

53
00:04:03.791 --> 00:04:05.625
<b>The only way is –</b>

54
00:04:05.625 --> 00:04:09.750
<b>to remain focused on the path</b>
<b>of attaining this knowledge,</b>

55
00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:15.708
<b>that is, to keep practicing Nishkam Karma </b>
<b>Yoga with patience and devotion.</b>

56
00:04:15.708 --> 00:04:18.291
<b>And then at the right time,</b>

57
00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:23.625
<b>this knowledge will spontaneously </b>
<b>be revealed within you.</b>

58
00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:35.833
<b>If there is one lesson to be learned</b>
<b>from this verse for personal life,</b>

59
00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:40.291
<b>it is of continuous practice and patience.</b>

60
00:04:40.291 --> 00:04:44.250
<b>Both these qualities are extremely necessary,</b>

61
00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:48.166
<b>whether it is a matter of spiritual knowledge</b>

62
00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:52.500
<b>or any other important goal in life.</b>

63
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:56.000
<b>Let's take a small example.</b>

64
00:04:56.000 --> 00:05:03.500
<b>You want to learn a musical instrument, </b>
<b>such as playing the sitar.</b>

65
00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:07.208
<b>In the beginning, all the notes will be out of tune,</b>

66
00:05:07.208 --> 00:05:11.833
<b>it will seem that you will never be able to learn it.</b>

67
00:05:11.833 --> 00:05:12.833
<b>But</b>

68
00:05:12.833 --> 00:05:17.666
<b>you will have to keep practicing continuously, </b>
<b>you will have to be patient.</b>

69
00:05:17.666 --> 00:05:22.875
<b>And then gradually, the notes of that </b>
<b>sitar will start sounding sweet,</b>

70
00:05:22.875 --> 00:05:26.125
<b>you will also start enjoying it,</b>

71
00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:30.291
<b>but still, the practice cannot be abandoned.</b>

72
00:05:30.291 --> 00:05:36.208
<b>And eventually, you will completely </b>
<b>learn that instrument.</b>

73
00:05:36.208 --> 00:05:41.958
<b>The same applies to every important goal in life.</b>

74
00:05:41.958 --> 00:05:48.458
<b>Spiritual development is also like this. </b>
<b>It will take time and practice.</b>

75
00:05:48.458 --> 00:05:49.583
<b>But</b>

76
00:05:49.583 --> 00:05:52.250
<b>many times people become impatient.</b>

77
00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:56.083
<b>Think about it, how strange this notion is,</b>

78
00:05:56.083 --> 00:06:01.916
<b>that someone wants to attain spiritual </b>
<b>knowledge in order to experience peace,</b>

79
00:06:01.916 --> 00:06:02.833
<b>but</b>

80
00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:07.666
<b>to obtain it, they have become restless.</b>

81
00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:09.791
<b>Reflect upon this.</b>

82
00:06:14.291 --> 00:06:20.625
<b>One will have to give time, make </b>
<b>efforts for spiritual knowledge.</b>

83
00:06:20.625 --> 00:06:27.000
<b>After giving all this, this knowledge </b>
<b>will arise spontaneously.</b>

84
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:32.458
<b>It can neither be obtained in a hurry nor by force.</b>

85
00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:37.625
<b>And all these things apply to</b>
<b>family relationships as well.</b>

86
00:06:37.625 --> 00:06:43.500
<b>Family love will neither be obtained </b>
<b>in a hurry nor by force.</b>

87
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:52.250
<b>By investing time and effort, this love </b>
<b>will gradually arise on its own.</b>

88
00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:56.291
<b>If you want the beautiful flowers of</b>
<b>family relationships to bloom, </b>

89
00:06:56.291 --> 00:06:58.875
<b>you will have to add the fertilizer of love,</b>

90
00:06:58.875 --> 00:07:03.416
<b>water that relationship with the water of help,</b>

91
00:07:03.416 --> 00:07:07.916
<b>and yes, you will have to be patient.</b>

92
00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:15.458
<b>Just as a plant takes time to grow, </b>
<b>people also change slowly.</b>

93
00:07:15.458 --> 00:07:20.208
<b>It also takes them time to </b>
<b>understand someone's love.</b>

94
00:07:20.208 --> 00:07:23.250
<b>And just like the plants in a garden,</b>

95
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:27.625
<b>some relationships take more time, some less.</b>

96
00:07:27.625 --> 00:07:34.000
<b>Adopt the principle of selfless effort </b>
<b>towards relationships as well.</b>

97
00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:49.541
<b>The role of patience and continuous effort is </b>
<b>most important in attaining spiritual knowledge.</b>

98
00:07:49.541 --> 00:07:52.000
<b>And in professional life too,</b>

99
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:58.375
<b>to rise above countless difficulties </b>
<b>and achieving lasting success,</b>

100
00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:03.958
<b>the role of patience and effort is most important.</b>

101
00:08:03.958 --> 00:08:11.583
<b>Take the example of an industrialist. </b>
<b>Does a successful industry get built overnight?</b>

102
00:08:11.583 --> 00:08:13.250
<b>No?</b>

103
00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.875
<b>Every day numerous challenges come,</b>

104
00:08:15.875 --> 00:08:20.833
<b>many times a result slips away just</b>
<b>as it is about to be grasped,</b>

105
00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:25.125
<b>one has to work with different types of people.</b>

106
00:08:25.125 --> 00:08:29.958
<b>All this requires constant effort and patience.</b>

107
00:08:29.958 --> 00:08:34.375
<b>This is the basic mantra of progress</b>
<b>in a professional setting,</b>

108
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:37.708
<b>do not harbor a craving for immediate results.</b>

109
00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:43.166
<b>This craving can also mislead you </b>
<b>towards unethical behavior.</b>

110
00:08:43.166 --> 00:08:48.083
<b>Keep making your efforts, improve </b>
<b>the quality of your work,</b>

111
00:08:48.083 --> 00:08:50.250
<b>take the support of ethics.</b>

112
00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.833
<b>These are all the foundations of success.</b>

113
00:08:52.833 --> 00:08:58.416
<b>And then as this foundation</b>
<b>becomes stronger over time,</b>

114
00:08:58.416 --> 00:09:02.375
<b>success will automatically follow you.</b>

